            "review_title": "Review at Wicked BBQ n Bar",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nBest BBQ in Hanoi\nOct 2020\nWhile there are some other BBQ options which have been around for some time (and are not bad), Wicked BBQ N Bar is absolutely the best option for American-style BBQ in Hanoi. This is a new place that's only been open for a few weeks. But, it's already off the ground and running smoothly. We had a fantastic meal there and found the meats to be incredible. Even the chicken (which can often get dried out) was really juicy. The brisket is awesome too as are the sides. (The sides portions are pretty much \"individually sized\" in case you're ordered \"for the table.\" \n\nSo, cute restaurant with plenty of comfortable seating, very reasonable prices, amazing food and nice staff - it's a hit. We'll be back soon enough!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 26, 2020",
